      "en": "It shall be, if you shall forget the LORD your God, and walk after other gods, and serve them and worship them, I testify against you today that you shall surely perish.",
      "ko": "네가 만일 네 하나님 여호와를 잊어버리고 다른 신들을 좇아 그들을 섬기며 그들에게 절하면 내가 너희에게 증거하노니 너희가 정녕히 멸망할 것이라",
      "source_text_hash": "4748015d7d0762d03bc0b6884fec9e157794924d906a273550c6b37fdd3dfa39",
      "translation_text_hash": "4bf562ae118214bd64485f1c42565b60325e5c74745f62fb79465fa76eaa818b",
